# Test your FastAPI endpoints

### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### RAG 混合查询（后向兼容）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/rag/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "mRNA疫苗的有效性数据是什么？"
}

###

### 邮件测试
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/mail/test?email=202330550711@mail.scut.edu.cn
Accept: application/json

###

### PubMed: 触发搜索并入库（auto_ingest=true 会执行向量索引，需 DASHSCOPE_API_KEY）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "COVID-19 mRNA vaccine efficacy",
  "max_results": 3,
  "auto_ingest": true
}

###

### PubMed: 分页浏览文献
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/articles?page=1&page_size=5
Accept: application/json

###

### PubMed: 按关键词模糊搜索
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/articles?search=vaccine&page=1&page_size=5
Accept: application/json

###

### PubMed: 按状态过滤（未入库）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/articles?ingestion_status=uningested&page=1&page_size=5
Accept: application/json

###

### PubMed: 获取单篇文献详情（替换为实际 PMID）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/articles/12345678
Accept: application/json

###

### PubMed: 手动索引单篇文献
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/ingest/12345678?force=false
Content-Type: application/json

###

### PubMed: 批量索引
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/ingest/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pmids": ["12345678", "87654321"],
  "force": false
}

###

### PubMed: 一键索引所有未入库文献
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/ingest/all-uningested
Content-Type: application/json

###

### PubMed: 删除文献（PG + ChromaDB 级联）
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/pubmed/articles/12345678
Accept: application/json

###

### 知识库统计
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/knowledge/stats
Accept: application/json

###
